# Starting Six — Local Configuration (DO NOT COMMIT)

Per-machine deployment details. This file is gitignored; copy it to `CLAUDE.local.md` and fill in
your own values. Store secrets in `.env.local` / `.env.production`, never here.

## Deployment Target
<e.g. Synology NAS via Docker Compose behind Caddy at https://starting-six.home → port 3002>

## API Keys
- None — PokéAPI is public, no auth required.

## Deploy Host Notes
- <Docker host + path, container/host port mapping, reverse-proxy hostname → port>

## End-of-session workflow
The generic branch → PR → CI-green → squash-merge sequence is your global
`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` checklist; keep only Starting Six's deltas here, e.g.:
- Merging to `main` auto-deploys the public EC2 demo (~5 min) — keep unrelated changes out.
- Synology deploy (when self-hosting): `./scripts/deploy.sh` (the `deploy` skill drives it).
- No migration step — `ensureSchema()` creates tables on boot.
